OL,3,AExplosion on Russian ship at Libya port
OL,4,Acaused by suspected drone attack,      
OL,5,Aofficials say                          
OL,7,FLater on Sunday, the health ministry   
OL,8,Fsaid it had received injured people    
OL,9,Ffrom another vessel, a commercial ship,
OL,10,Fthat was also targeted off the coast of
OL,11,FBenghazi, state media reported. Their  
OL,12,Finjuries were minor and their condition
OL,13,Fstable, the ministry said.             
